# Runtime state, not build input. Every one of these is a bind mount in
# docker-compose - uploads, thumbnails, backups, the Postgres volume, the dev
# certs - and no Dockerfile reads any of them. Left out of the ignore list they
# were still SENT: on a machine holding the real library that is ~10 GB of build
# context transferred before a one-line C# change compiles, every time.
data/
test-results/
test-report/
**/playwright-report
